description:
lib.rs exports bare modules (pub mod auth; etc.) but does not re-export primary types. Downstream crates must use paths like kith_core::chat::Chat instead of kith_core::Chat.

Fix: add to lib.rs:
  pub use auth::{Identity, Role};
  pub use chat::{Chat, compute_chat_id};
  pub use contact::Contact;
  pub use error::{AuthError, JmapError, KithError};
  pub use jmap::{Id, Invocation, JmapRequest, JmapResponse, MethodError, UTCDate};
  pub use message::{Attachment, DeliveryState, Message};
  pub use resultref::{Argument, ResultReference};

Why this matters: if any module is refactored into a subdirectory, all downstream imports break. Crate-level re-exports are the stable API surface.
